    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b4df0862630e4f4686d16b149c650c70",
      "statement": "Make targets in the Makefile wrap the Python CLI commands: `make dev` runs `uv run pipeline dev`, and `make build` runs `uv run pipeline build`, enabling convenience invocation via Make.",
